# BLOODCLOT: a new project starts at the desk with its riddim; the top row drops a channel (a tap: it stays out; a
# hold: out while held), the bottom row throws it into the echo while held (PATCH held: the spring)
wait 300
listen
expect page Mix
expect mute 0
shot bc_desk_rest
# a tap on pad 2 (BASS): dropped, and it stays
tappad 1 100
wait 60
said DROP
expect mute 2
# again: back in
tappad 1 100
wait 60
said IN
expect mute 0
# held past a tap: out while held, back as it was at the let go
pad 2 100
wait 500
expect mute 4
pad 2 0
wait 60
expect mute 0
# the bottom row: thrown while held
pad 9 100
wait 100
expect thrown 2
shot bc_desk_throw
pad 9 0
wait 60
expect thrown 0
# PATCH held: the spring
press HOME
pad 10 100
wait 100
expect thrown 1024
pad 10 0
release HOME
wait 60
expect thrown 0
expect page Mix
# it plays: the riddim sounds, and a throw of the skank is heard in the echo's return
tap PLAY
wait 2000
expect playing 1
shot bc_desk_play
tap PLAY
